    {
      "name": "01 - OAuth (Wajib Sebelum Testing Lain)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Get Token (password grant - real user_id)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token_user', json.accessToken);",
                  "    console.log('access_token_user saved (passenger user_id=' + json.user.id + '):', json.accessToken);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "password"
                },
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "budi@mail.com"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "123456"
                },
                {
                  "key": "client_id",
                  "value": "smart-transport-app"
                },
                {
                  "key": "client_secret",
                  "value": "smart-transport-secret"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{oauth_url}}/oauth/token",
              "host": [
                "{{oauth_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "oauth",
                "token"
              ]
            },
            "description": "PENTING — pakai request ini (bukan client_credentials) untuk endpoint yang butuh user_id asli, seperti POST /api/tickets. \n\ngetUserFromClient() di oauth model.js SELALU return {id: 0} untuk client_credentials grant — dan karena 0 itu falsy di JavaScript, authMiddleware.js TIDAK PERNAH set header X-User-Id untuk grant itu. Akibatnya endpoint yang cek X-User-Id (misal TicketController::store) selalu 401.\n\nKredensial terverifikasi dari seed: email budi@mail.com (passenger id=1, Budi Santoso) / password plaintext '123456' (sudah diverifikasi cocok dengan hash bcrypt seed). Client smart-transport-app punya grant_types 'password,refresh_token' (BUKAN client_credentials).\n\nPassenger seed lain yang bisa dipakai sama (password sama '123456'): siti@mail.com (id=2), ahmad@mail.com (id=3), dewi@mail.com (id=4), rizky@mail.com (id=5). Passenger id 6+ (andi@mail.com dst) punya hash placeholder TIDAK VALID ('$2y$10$dummyhash...') — tidak akan bisa login sampai di-replace hash asli."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Get Token (password grant - Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"access_token_admin\", json.accessToken);",
                  "    console.log(\"access_token_admin saved (role=admin):\", json.accessToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "password"
                },
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "admin@mail.com"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "123456"
                },
                {
                  "key": "client_id",
                  "value": "smart-transport-app"
                },
                {
                  "key": "client_secret",
                  "value": "smart-transport-secret"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{oauth_url}}/oauth/token",
              "host": [
                "{{oauth_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "oauth",
                "token"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Login sebagai admin. Token disimpan ke {{access_token_admin}}. Pakai token ini untuk endpoint yang butuh role admin: POST/PATCH/DELETE /api/buses dan POST/PATCH/DELETE /api/routes. Gateway inject header x-user-role=admin dari hasil introspect token, lalu php-fleet cek via RoleFilter."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Get Token (client_credentials - IoT/service-to-service)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token_iot', json.accessToken);",
                  "    console.log('access_token_iot saved (service/IoT, user_id always 0):', json.accessToken);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "client_credentials"
                },
                {
                  "key": "client_id",
                  "value": "{{client_id}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "client_secret",
                  "value": "{{client_secret}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{oauth_url}}/oauth/token",
              "host": [
                "{{oauth_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "oauth",
                "token"
              ]
            },
            "description": "PENTING: pakai client_credentials HANYA untuk skenario IoT/service-to-service (GPS update, passenger count, dst) — JANGAN dipakai untuk endpoint yang mewakili passenger tertentu seperti beli tiket atau lihat notifikasi sendiri.\n\ngetUserFromClient() di oauth model.js selalu return {id: 0} untuk grant ini, sehingga X-User-Id yang di-inject gateway tidak pernah ter-set (0 bersifat falsy di JS) — endpoint yang mengecek X-User-Id (TicketController, NotifController) akan selalu balas 401 'Unauthorized' kalau dikasih token ini. Untuk endpoint itu, pakai 'POST Get Token (password grant)' di atas sebagai gantinya — hasilnya tersimpan di variable terpisah {{access_token_user}}, sehingga tidak akan saling menimpa dengan {{access_token_iot}} dari request ini."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Introspect Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token_user}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{oauth_url}}/oauth/introspect",
              "host": [
                "{{oauth_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "oauth",
                "introspect"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Expected: {\"active\":true,\"user_id\":1,...}. Default pakai access_token_user — ganti value jadi {{access_token_iot}} di body kalau mau cek token IoT (expected user_id:0)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Revoke Token (jalankan TERAKHIR, akan invalidate token)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token_user}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{oauth_url}}/oauth/revoke",
              "host": [
                "{{oauth_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "oauth",
                "revoke"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Default revoke access_token_user. Ganti value jadi {{access_token_iot}} di body kalau mau revoke token IoT sebagai gantinya."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
